    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE DHAMMADEEPA FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.05,
      401.9,
      288.95
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as\u201cDhammadeepa Foundation\u201d has heretofore has been formedFor the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects andtransacting all matters connected with the said Foundationaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      302.45,
      401.91,
      363.35
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has appliedto be incorporated and it will be advantageous to grant saidapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      376.85,
      401.89,
      400.55
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      413.93,
      401.89,
      437.75
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the DhammadeepaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      451.13,
      401.93,
      574.07
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cDhammadeepa Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a bodycorporate, with perpetual succession under the name andstyle of the \u201cDhammadeepa Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referredto as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and besued, with full power and authority to have and use a commonseal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      587.57,
      401.87,
      611.27
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      624.77,
      401.88,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)to create an educational, social, healthy andeconomic background to make Sri Lanka aDharmadeepaya (an island of canon) withdisciplined and righteous society;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      228.55,
      443.14,
      237.62
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      415.63,
      444.58,
      424.7
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
