    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      238.97,
      393.46,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)to do charitable services under different projects;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      262.97,
      397.15,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(i)For a quality education;(ii)For economic development activies;(iii)Projects such as awarding of scholarship toeconomically backward students.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      322.97,
      397.2,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)going to remote under developedvillages and providing them with various reliefafter identifying their difficulties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      370.97,
      397.16,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "(e)after identifying threats to Buddhism and the nationand implementing steps to eradicate them.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      406.97,
      397.16,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law perform and execut the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      442.97,
      397.17,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)to raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donations,in cash or kind and requesting subscriptions;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      478.97,
      397.2,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)to acquire, in any manner whatsoever and hold,take of give on lease or hire, rent, sell or otherwisedispose of, any movable or immovable propertyand construct, maintain and alter any buildings orworks necessary or convenient for the business ofthe Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      562.97,
      397.16,
      586.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)to open, operate and close bank accounts andborrow or raise money with or without security;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      598.97,
      397.17,
      634.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)to invest any funds not immediately required forthe purpose of the Corporation in such manner asthe elected Executive Committee may determine.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      646.97,
      397.16,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "(e)to enter into agreements or contracts with anypersons or body of persons;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
